{"id":"podrobno","lemma":"подробно","pos":"adv","rank":4540,"glosses":["in detail"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D0%BF%D0%BE%D0%B4%D1%80%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Более подробно смотрите ниже.","en":"Please see below for more details.","words":[{"g":"more"},null,{"g":"to look, to gaze","l":"смотреть"},{"g":"below, beneath, under"}]},{"text":"Я могу подробно это объяснить, если хочешь.","en":"I can explain this in detail if you want me to.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to explain"},{"g":"if, in case"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Том подробно ответил.","en":"Tom answered in detail.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to answer, to reply","l":"ответить"}]},{"text":"Кто-нибудь может мне это подробно объяснить?","en":"Can someone explain it to me in detail?","words":[{"g":"who"},null,{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"to explain"}]},{"text":"Он подробно это объяснил.","en":"He explained it in detail.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to explain","l":"объяснить"}]}]}